Notes on things not fully implemented from the spec:

- **Captured fighter turning hostile when its Boss is killed in formation** — the spec is self-contradictory there ("destroys the captured fighter along with it"); I chose destruction rather than making it hostile.
- **Entry-path variety** is limited to four curved Bezier entry shapes cycled per group (the arcade has more elaborate looping entry choreography per group).
- **Enemy re-entry after leaving the bottom** always returns straight to its slot rather than replaying a curved entry loop.
- The title screen's score table is a simplified layout (no separate "×2/×1" escort-column labels with connecting graphics).
- Challenging-stage waves fly a single looping sine path (staggered snake of 8) rather than five distinct arcade loop patterns.
